imensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"categorical-and-numerical-data\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 5 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 5 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 5 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Value-এর meaning অনুযায়ী variable classify করুন। এই choice valid summary, chart, model ও interpretation নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে।\" data-en=\"Classify variables by what their values mean. This choice controls valid summaries, charts, models, and interpretations.\">Classify variables by what their values mean. This choice controls valid summaries, charts, models, and interpretations.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 35 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Categorical ও numerical variable আলাদা করুন।\" data-en=\"Distinguish categorical and numerical variables.\">Distinguish categorical and numerical variables.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Number-এর মতো দেখানো identifier চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize identifiers disguised as numbers.\">Recognize identifiers disguised as numbers.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"প্রতিটি type-এর suitable summary বেছে নিন।\" data-en=\"Choose suitable summaries for each type.\">Choose suitable summaries for each type.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Meaningless arithmetic এড়ান।\" data-en=\"Avoid meaningless arithmetic.\">Avoid meaningless arithmetic.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Categorical data\" data-en=\"Categorical data\">Categorical data</h2><p data-bn=\"Categorical variable observation-কে label বা group-এ রাখে: district, product category, payment method বা yes/no status। Useful summary count, proportion, mode, cross-tab ও bar chart। 1=Dhaka, 2=Khulna code হলেও label।\" data-en=\"Categorical variables place observations into labels or groups: district, product category, payment method, or yes/no status. Useful summaries are counts, proportions, mode, cross-tabulations, and bar charts. Category codes such as 1=Dhaka and 2=Khulna are still labels.\">Categorical variables place observations into labels or groups: district, product category, payment method, or yes/no status. Useful summaries are counts, proportions, mode, cross-tabulations, and bar charts. Category codes such as 1=Dhaka and 2=Khulna are still labels.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Numerical data\" data-en=\"Numerical data\">Numerical data</h2><p data-bn=\"Numerical variable quantity represent করে যেখানে arithmetic meaningful: age, unit sold, revenue, weight বা duration। Scale ও distribution অনুযায়ী total, mean, median, spread, histogram ও model ব্যবহার হয়।\" data-en=\"Numerical variables represent quantities where arithmetic is meaningful: age, units sold, revenue, weight, or duration. Depending on measurement scale and distribution, analysts use totals, means, medians, spread, histograms, and numerical models.\">Numerical variables represent quantities where arithmetic is meaningful: age, units sold, revenue, weight, or duration. Depending on measurement scale and distribution, analysts use totals, means, medians, spread, histograms, and numerical models.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Storage type-এর আগে meaning\" data-en=\"Meaning before storage type\">Meaning before storage type</h2><p data-bn=\"Software value-কে number, text, date বা Boolean হিসেবে store করতে পারে, কিন্তু analytical type meaning-এর ওপর নির্ভর করে। Postal code, phone, customer ID digit হলেও categorical identifier। 1–5 star rating ordinal categorical।\" data-en=\"Software may store a value as a number, text, date, or Boolean, but analytical type depends on meaning. Postal code, phone number, and customer ID may contain digits but are categorical identifiers. A star rating is ordinal categorical even though 1–5 are numbers.\">Software may store a value as a number, text, date, or Boolean, but analytical type depends on meaning. Postal code, phone number, and customer ID may contain digits but are categorical identifiers. A star rating is ordinal categorical even though 1–5 are numbers.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Categorical variable\" data-en=\"Categorical variable\">Categorical variable</h3><p data-bn=\"যার value label বা group represent করে।\" data-en=\"A variable whose values represent labels or groups.\">A variable whose values represent labels or groups.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Numerical variable\" data-en=\"Numerical variable\">Numerical variable</h3><p data-bn=\"যার value measurable বা countable quantity represent করে।\" data-en=\"A variable whose values represent measurable or countable quantities.\">A variable whose values represent measurable or countable quantities.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Binary variable\" data-en=\"Binary variable\">Binary variable</h3><p data-bn=\"দুই state-এর categorical variable।\" data-en=\"A categorical variable with two states.\">A categorical variable with two states.</p><small class=\"term-example\" data-bn=\"Paid / unpaid\" data-en=\"Paid / unpaid\">Paid / unpaid</small></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Identifier\" data-en=\"Identifier\">Identifier</h3><p data-bn=\"Record distinguish করার label, average করার quantity নয়।\" data-en=\"A label used to distinguish records, not a quantity to average.\">A label used to distinguish records, not a quantity to average.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"HR dataset classify\" data-en=\"Classifying an HR dataset\">Classifying an HR dataset</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Field: employee_id, department, age, monthly_salary, performance_rating, resigned।\" data-en=\"Fields: employee_id, department, age, monthly_salary, performance_rating, resigned.\">Fields: employee_id, department, age, monthly_salary, performance_rating, resigned.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"employee_id categorical identifier।\" data-en=\"employee_id is a categorical identifier.\">employee_id is a categorical identifier.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"department ও resigned categorical।\" data-en=\"department and resigned are categorical.\">department and resigned are categorical.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"age ও monthly_salary numerical।\" data-en=\"age and monthly_salary are numerical.\">age and monthly_salary are numerical.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Validated numerical scale না থাকলে performance_rating সাধারণত ordinal categorical।\" data-en=\"performance_rating is usually ordinal categorical unless a validated numerical scale justifies arithmetic.\">performance_rating is usually ordinal categorical unless a validated numerical scale justifies arithmetic.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Correct typing average employee ID বা category code-এর unjustified mean-এর মতো invalid summary prevent করে।\" data-en=\"Correct typing prevents invalid summaries such as the average employee ID or an unjustified mean of category codes.\">Correct typing prevents invalid summaries such as the average employee ID or an unjustified mean of category codes.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Appearance নয়, meaning অনুযায়ী variable type করুন।\" data-en=\"Type variables by meaning, not appearance.\">Type variables by meaning, not appearance.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Categorical variable-এ count ও proportion ব্যবহার হয়।\" data-en=\"Categorical variables use counts and proportions.\">Categorical variables use counts and proportions.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Numerical variable meaningful arithmetic support করে।\" data-en=\"Numerical variables support meaningful arithmetic.\">Numerical variables support meaningful arithmetic.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Number হিসেবে stored হলেও identifier label।\" data-en=\"Identifiers are labels even if stored as numbers.\">Identifiers are labels even if stored as numbers.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-3-frequency-frequency-tables-and-levels-of-measurement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Frequency Tables and Levels of Measurement ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://ukdataservice.ac.uk/help/new-users/data-documentation/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">UK Data Service — Data Documentation ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}